{"id":"vod_sn_36492","vodId":"36492","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"付丧神出租中","name_cn":"付丧神出租中","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ededb5d1605113b913ef4d4c4de8af15.jpg"},"summary":"个性开朗同时又成熟稳重的阿红（小松未可子 配音）和弟弟清次（夏木淳弥 配音）过着相依为命的生活，两人共同经营着一件名为出云屋的古董店，店里所售卖的，全部都是有着上百年历史的老古董，时间的精华凝聚在这些古董上，使得这些看似普通的物品上被附着了名为“付丧神”的灵体，而这些付丧神们，会帮助将它们买回家的主人们解决遇到的种种问题。　　沉默寡言性格非常冷漠的野铁（奈良彻 配音）、如同满月一般圆润，性格古板而又认真的月夜见（仲野裕 配音）、老成而又稳重的五位（平川大辅 配音）、美艳不可方物的公主（明坂聪美 配音），这些付丧神们在人类的悲喜前展现出了他们对于人生的不同见解。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RaSEKLAHqY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kyAg0PBAAq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zTcN0Wnk1F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZHEGgNr3ku1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eFpCpvu54H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fNAVpRj5Pf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hcs5FYZmgg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WikHjC6eZS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6zgHdF9KZm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bANCApwawG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AsHcdLiDQ31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/j2ty4JnKL91/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:21.999Z"}